mpv-mpris: mpv-mpris (plugin to control mpv with media keys)
mpv-mpris:
mpv-mpris: mpv-mpris is a plugin for mpv which allows control of the player using
mpv-mpris: standard media keys. This plugin implements the MPRIS D-Bus interface
mpv-mpris: and can be controlled using tools such as playerctl or through many
mpv-mpris: open source desktop environments such as GNOME and KDE.
